iterations.reply:
I've removed the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The build rejects any import outside the node's `with` clause, and that clause currently grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. So the fetch can't be included until the graph definition grants `HTTPClient` to `ParseMessage`. After that release, the fetch can be added back as a fire-and-forget `http_client::fetch` call. The node's output was never meant to depend on it, so the output is the same either way.

